    title: "Ikponmwosa Erhinmwinrose and the $90 Million Identity-Theft Fraud Ring That Targeted Pandemic Relief Programs",
    slug: "ikponmwosa-erhinmwinrose-pandemic-relief-identity-fraud",
    author: 'ScamShield Editorial',
    tags: ['notorious', 'notorious-scammer'],
