    title: "Jose Encarnacion and the Trinity Real Estate Investment Fraud",
    slug: 'jose-encarnacion-trinity-real-estate-fraud',
    author: 'ScamShield Editorial',
    tags: ['notorious', 'notorious-scammer'],
